-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"א/8, 5 July 2021: קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשפ"א;
-- קצובת ביגוד לעובדי הוראה בחינוך הגופני ובחינוך הטכנולוגי
-- The clothing allowance for school year תשפ"א: who is entitled, the
-- amount (level 4), pro-rating for the position and for several
-- employers, the employment ceilings; the extra allowance for physical-
-- education teachers by position; and the shoes and robes of teachers in
-- technological education by profession.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time in the regulative rules is counted in school months of תשפ"א
-- (common.l4: September 2020 = 1, so the July 2021 salary is month 11).

§ `חוזר תשפ"א/8 קצובת ביגוד`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead and page footer, date (5.7.2021), reference number, addressee (the owners of educational institutions), greeting, subject line and the list of the three subjects; no rule.

§§ `1 קצובת ביגוד לשנת הלימודים תשפ"א`

@desc A teaching employee's school year תשפ"א at one employer, as far as the circular asks about it.
DECLARE `clothing year` HAS
    `graded in the teaching-employees grading`  IS A BOOLEAN
    `employed by an owner the Ministry supervises` IS A BOOLEAN
    `position fraction at this employer`        IS A NUMBER  @desc the share of a full position held at this employer (1 = 100%)
    `a physical-education teacher`              IS A BOOLEAN
    `technological profession`                  IS A STRING  @desc the profession taught in technological education, as the lists print it; "" for none

-- ¶1-¶2: whom it applies to; ¶3: as the Treasury's instructions direct.
@ref akn:art_1/p1 akn:art_1/p2 akn:art_1/p3 akn:art_1/p4
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the clothing rules apply to` y IF
        y's `graded in the teaching-employees grading`
    AND y's `employed by an owner the Ministry supervises`

-- 1ב-1ג: entitled as public-facing staff in the civil service are, for
-- school year תשפ"א (09/20-08/21), at level 4: 2,148 shekels.
@ref akn:art_1__para_b akn:art_1__para_c
`the level-4 clothing allowance` MEANS 2148

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_08-a: 1ד pays by the position fraction "and not more
-- than one full position"; 1ה pays an employee of several employers, whose
-- total is above 100%, each employer's own share. For 80% and 60%:
`the employer shares 1ה gives for 80% and 60%` MEANS
    LIST 0.8, 0.6

`1ד's cap and 1ה disagree for two employers` MEANS
    sum `the employer shares 1ה gives for 80% and 60%` GREATER THAN 1
#ASSERT `1ד's cap and 1ה disagree for two employers`

-- The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_08-a): 1ה, the rule for several
-- employers, governs them; 1ד's cap is at each employer.
@ref akn:art_1__para_d akn:art_1__para_e
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `position share` y IS
    min (y's `position fraction at this employer`) 1

@export default The clothing allowance in shekels one employer pays a teaching employee for school year 2020-21 under circular תשפ"א/8, before the physical-education and technological-education extras
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year` @desc the employee's year at this employer
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `clothing allowance` y IS
    IF `the clothing rules apply to` y
    THEN `the level-4 clothing allowance` TIMES `position share` y
    ELSE 0

DECLARE `clothing action` IS ONE OF
    `pay the clothing allowance` HAS `clothing paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the physical-education allowance` HAS `physical-education paid` IS A NUMBER
    `pay the technological-education allowance` HAS `technological paid` IS A NUMBER
    `employ beyond the ceiling` HAS `scope employed` IS A NUMBER

-- 1א: paid in full with the July 2021 salary.
@ref akn:art_1__para_a
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the clothing allowance with July's salary` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the clothing allowance` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `clothing allowance` y
    WITHIN `month number` July
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/8 1a: the clothing allowance is paid in full with the July 2021 salary"

-- 1ו: ceilings on the total scope at all employers, subject to the
-- exceptional-employment procedure for תשפ"א (an input). ¶5: nothing here
-- changes the conditions for approval or permits employment beyond them.
DECLARE `employment terms` IS ONE OF
    `a teaching employee not under a reform`
    `a principal not under a reform`
    `a teacher under עוז לתמורה in full implementation`
    `a teacher under אופק חדש`

-- F-2020-21_tashpa_08-b: the 140% ceiling is laid on "a teaching
-- employee", which a principal is, and a principal not under the reform
-- has a ceiling of 150% too.
GIVEN t IS AN `employment terms`
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the ceilings 1ו lays on` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `a teaching employee not under a reform` THEN LIST 1.40
    WHEN `a principal not under a reform` THEN LIST 1.40, 1.50
    WHEN `a teacher under עוז לתמורה in full implementation` THEN LIST 1.40, 1.25
    WHEN `a teacher under אופק חדש` THEN LIST 1.40, 1.17

`a principal not under the reform has two ceilings` MEANS
    `the ceilings 1ו lays on` `a principal not under a reform` EQUALS LIST 1.40, 1.50
#ASSERT `a principal not under the reform has two ceilings`

-- The reading adopted (F-2020-21_tashpa_08-b): each group's own ceiling
-- governs it — 150% for a principal not under a reform, and the reform
-- ceilings for teachers under a reform; 140% is the ceiling of a teaching
-- employee not under a reform, as ¶5 puts it ("140% משרה - ללא רפורמה").
@ref akn:art_1__para_f akn:art_1__para_f/p2 akn:art_1__para_f/p3 akn:art_1__para_f/p4 akn:art_1/p5
GIVEN t IS AN `employment terms`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `employment ceiling` t IS
    CONSIDER t
    WHEN `a teaching employee not under a reform` THEN 1.40
    WHEN `a principal not under a reform` THEN 1.50
    WHEN `a teacher under עוז לתמורה in full implementation` THEN 1.25
    WHEN `a teacher under אופק חדש` THEN 1.17

GIVEN t IS AN `employment terms`
      `the exceptional-employment procedure permits it` IS A BOOLEAN @desc whether the exceptional-employment procedure for 2020-21 allows the excess; an input
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `no employment beyond the ceiling` t `the exceptional-employment procedure permits it` IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    SHANT `employ beyond the ceiling` `scope`
          PROVIDED `scope` GREATER THAN `employment ceiling` t
                   AND NOT `the exceptional-employment procedure permits it`
    WITHIN 12
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/8 1f: no employment above the ceiling at all employers, save under the exceptional-employment procedure"

§§ `2 קצובת ביגוד נוספת למורה לחינוך גופני`

-- ¶1: on top of the general allowance (sun protection included). ¶2: the
-- amounts of circular תשע"ב/8 are updated to the table, correct to 1.9.20.
@ref akn:art_2/p1 akn:art_2/p2 akn:art_2/t1
DECLARE `physical-education band` HAS
    `from fraction`       IS A NUMBER
    `from included`       IS A BOOLEAN
    `to fraction`         IS A NUMBER
    `to included`         IS A BOOLEAN
    `band shekels`        IS A NUMBER

-- One row per printed line: "less than a third" (33.333%), "from a third
-- to half inclusive" (50%), "above half". 9 stands for no upper bound.
`the physical-education table` MEANS
    LIST `physical-education band` 0       TRUE  (1 DIVIDED BY 3) FALSE 0,
         `physical-education band` (1 DIVIDED BY 3) TRUE  0.5 TRUE  685,
         `physical-education band` 0.5     FALSE 9   TRUE  1368

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER, b IS A `physical-education band`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `in band` f b IF
        (f GREATER THAN b's `from fraction` OR (b's `from included` AND f EQUALS b's `from fraction`))
    AND (f LESS THAN b's `to fraction` OR (b's `to included` AND f EQUALS b's `to fraction`))

GIVEN f IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the physical-education amounts at` f IS
    map (GIVEN b YIELD b's `band shekels`) (filter (GIVEN b YIELD `in band` f b) `the physical-education table`)

-- The bands meet with no gap and no overlap.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN f YIELD count (`the physical-education amounts at` f) EQUALS 1)
            (LIST 0.1, 0.33, 1 DIVIDED BY 3, 0.4, 0.5, 0.51, 1, 1.2)

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `physical-education allowance` y IS
    IF `the clothing rules apply to` y AND y's `a physical-education teacher`
    THEN sum (`the physical-education amounts at` (y's `position fraction at this employer`))
    ELSE 0

-- No month is printed for this payment; the allowance is for school year
-- תשפ"א, so the year bounds it.
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the physical-education allowance` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the physical-education allowance` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `physical-education allowance` y
    WITHIN 12
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/8 2: the physical-education teacher's extra clothing allowance is paid for 2020-21"

§§ `3 קצובת ביגוד בחינוך הטכנולוגי`

-- 3.1א: a pair of shoes and two robes a year (566 shekels) for these
-- professions; 3.1ב: two robes a year (352 shekels) for these.
@ref akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_a akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_a/t1 akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_a/p2
`the shoes-and-robes professions` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות תעופה", "מכטרוניקה", "טרמודינמיקה טכנית ימית", "מערכות סיב\"מ ותיב\"מ",
         "תחזוקת מערכות מכניות", "מערכות מכונאות רכב", "מערכות ממוחשבות ברכב",
         "מערכות הספק, פיקוד ובקרה", "מערכות בקרת אקלים", "אומנות הבישול והאפיה המלונאית",
         "ימאות – ספינות", "מערכות טלוויזיה וקולנוע", "מערכות צילום"

`a pair of shoes and two robes` MEANS 566

@ref akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_b akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_b/t1 akn:art_3__para_1__subpara_b/p2
`the two-robes professions` MEANS
    LIST "מערכות אלקטרוניות", "מערכות מחשוב ובקרה", "מערכות מחשבים", "תכנון ותכנות מערכות",
         "מערכות ביוטכנולוגיה", "ניהול תיירותי", "ניהול מלונאי",
         "חינוך לגיל הרך", "עיצוב", "אופנה ותלבושות", "עיצוב שיער, וטיפוח החן",
         "סיעוד", "אומנות שימושית"

`two robes` MEANS 352

-- Each list prints 13 professions and no profession is in both.
#ASSERT count `the shoes-and-robes professions` EQUALS 13 AND count `the two-robes professions` EQUALS 13
#ASSERT all (GIVEN p YIELD NOT elem p `the two-robes professions`) `the shoes-and-robes professions`

-- ¶1 and 3.2-3.3: for a teacher or vocational instructor in technological
-- education, on top of the general allowance, pro-rated to the position and
-- for no more than one full position.
@ref akn:art_3/p1 akn:art_3__para_2 akn:art_3__para_3
GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `technological-education allowance` y IS
    IF NOT `the clothing rules apply to` y
    THEN 0
    ELSE IF elem (y's `technological profession`) `the shoes-and-robes professions`
         THEN `a pair of shoes and two robes` TIMES `position share` y
         ELSE IF elem (y's `technological profession`) `the two-robes professions`
              THEN `two robes` TIMES `position share` y
              ELSE 0

GIVEN y IS A `clothing year`
GIVETH A DEONTIC Party `clothing action`
DECIDE `paying the technological-education allowance` y IS
    PARTY `the employer`
    MUST  `pay the technological-education allowance` `amount`
          PROVIDED `amount` AT LEAST `technological-education allowance` y
    WITHIN 12
    LEST  BREACH BY `the employer` BECAUSE "circular 2020-21/8 3: the technological-education clothing allowance is paid for 2020-21"

-- akn:conclusions The contact line, signatures and copies list; no rule.

-- Worked examples: the shekel figures are the circular's own.
`a full-time physical-education teacher` MEANS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `graded in the teaching-employees grading`  IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner the Ministry supervises` IS TRUE
        `position fraction at this employer`        IS 1
        `a physical-education teacher`              IS TRUE
        `technological profession`                  IS ""

`a 40% mechatronics instructor` MEANS
    `clothing year` WITH
        `graded in the teaching-employees grading`  IS TRUE
        `employed by an owner the Ministry supervises` IS TRUE
        `position fraction at this employer`        IS 0.4
        `a physical-education teacher`              IS FALSE
        `technological profession`                  IS "מכטרוניקה"

#ASSERT `clothing allowance` `a full-time physical-education teacher` EQUALS 2148
#ASSERT `physical-education allowance` `a full-time physical-education teacher` EQUALS 1368
#ASSERT `clothing allowance` `a 40% mechatronics instructor` EQUALS 859.2
#ASSERT `technological-education allowance` `a 40% mechatronics instructor` EQUALS 226.4
#ASSERT `employment ceiling` `a principal not under a reform` EQUALS 1.50

#TRACE `paying the clothing allowance with July's salary` `a full-time physical-education teacher` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the clothing allowance` 2148 AT 11
#TRACE `paying the clothing allowance with July's salary` `a full-time physical-education teacher` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `pay the clothing allowance` 2148 AT 12
#TRACE `no employment beyond the ceiling` `a teacher under אופק חדש` FALSE AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the employer` DOES `employ beyond the ceiling` 1.2 AT 2
